=== scope
fb Fx a => q1
instance t2 Fx
=== text
%LANGUAGE FBD
%NETWORK
t2(a := a, OUT => k);
=== refused
network-plain-st declares no output OUT

#### operator-pin-out-of-place — an operator runs by position, whatever its names say: SUB(IN2 := i, IN1 := j) is i - j (live CODESYS 3.5.21.40)
=== text
%LANGUAGE FBD
%NETWORK
ASSIGN(SUB(IN2 := i, IN1 := j), Q => k);
=== refused
network-plain-st the box SUB names its pin IN1 out of place

