=== text
%LANGUAGE FBD
%NETWORK
ASSIGN(SEL(IN1 := j, G := go, IN0 := i), Q => k);
=== refused
network-plain-st the box SEL names its pin G out of place

#### empty-input-pin — an unconnected pin is left out, the rail is RAIL()
=== scope
instance t1 TON
fb TON IN PT => Q ET
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
t1(IN := , PT := T#1S);
=== refused
network-plain-st an operand at

#### empty-en-pin — an unconnected EN is left out
=== text
%LANGUAGE FBD
%NETWORK
MOVE(EN := , 1, OUT => n);
=== refused
network-plain-st an operand at

#### empty-output-pin — an unconnected output is left out
