instance t1 TON
fb TON IN PT => Q ET
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
t1(IN := a, PT := T#1S, ET => );
=== refused
network-plain-st an output target at

#### old-form-coil — y := a; is no network text: a coil is ASSIGN
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
y := a;
=== refused
network-plain-st a coil is ASSIGN(value, Q => y)

